{"title": "Vampiric Vermin", "pageid": 46772, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Vampiric_Vermin", "categories": ["Actions", "Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For other versions of this ability, see <a href=\"/wiki/Bite_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bite (disambiguation)\">Bite (disambiguation)</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Bite.webp/300px-Bite.webp, /w/images/8/86/Bite.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Bite.webp/300px-Bite.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Bite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>This version of <b>Bite</b> is an action used by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Giant_Rat\" title=\"Giant Rat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Giant_Rat.png/25px-Portrait_Giant_Rat.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Giant_Rat.png/38px-Portrait_Giant_Rat.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Giant_Rat.png/50px-Portrait_Giant_Rat.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Giant Rats\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Giant_Rat.png/25px-Portrait_Giant_Rat.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Portrait_Giant_Rat.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Giant_Rat\" title=\"Giant Rat\">Giant Rats</a> which deals piercing damage.\n